<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS4" title="In Appendix C Additional Experimental Results ‣ Document Summarization withConformal Importance Guarantees" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.4 </span>ROUGE Score-based Ground Truth Performance</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS5" title="In Appendix C Additional Experimental Results ‣ Document Summarization withConformal Importance Guarantees" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.5 </span>Ablation over Calibration Set Size</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS6" title="In Appendix C Additional Experimental Results ‣ Document Summarization withConformal Importance Guarantees" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.6 </span>Direct Abstractive and Hybrid Extractive-Abstractive Comparison</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
