<div id="A2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Importance Scoring.</span> To generate LLM-based scores <math id="A2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R(c_{i};y^{*})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R(c_{i};y^{*})</annotation></semantics></math> for Conformal Importance Summarization, the source text was provided to an LLM along with the individual sentences from that text as separate strings. The prompt in Listing <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span> was used to produce a list of importance scores between 0 and 1 corresponding to each input sentence.</p>
</div>
