<div id="A2.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sentence-level Recall Estimation.</span> Unlike for extractive summaries, determining if an abstractive summary has retained a specific piece of important information requires a judgement call. Hence, we estimated recall of sentence-level information using GPT4o-mini prompted to determine if the content of a sentence is retained in an abstractive summary.</p>
</div>
