<section id="A3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.3 </span>Target Recall vs. Conciseness Plots for all Datasets and Methods</h3>

<div id="A3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figures <a href="#A3.F17" title="Figure 17 ‣ C.3 Target Recall vs. Conciseness Plots for all Datasets and Methods ‣ Appendix C Additional Experimental Results ‣ Document Summarization withConformal Importance Guarantees" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a> - <a href="#A3.F20" title="Figure 20 ‣ C.3 Target Recall vs. Conciseness Plots for all Datasets and Methods ‣ Appendix C Additional Experimental Results ‣ Document Summarization withConformal Importance Guarantees" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a> show the conciseness, the proportion of sentences removed, based on the choice of <math id="A3.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> for all datasets and methods<span id="footnote5" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">5</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">5</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">5</span>
              
              
              
              
              
              
              
            Due to computational constraints, we only compute this plot for LexRank on the CNN/DM dataset</span></span></span>, analogous to <a href="#S5.F4" title="In 5.2 Effect of 𝛼 and 𝛽 ‣ 5 Results ‣ Document Summarization withConformal Importance Guarantees" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> in <a href="#S5.SS1" title="5.1 Testing the Coverage Guarantee ‣ 5 Results ‣ Document Summarization withConformal Importance Guarantees" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.1</span></a>. Once again, the trend is highly similar across settings, with higher <math id="A3.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> leading to a smaller reduction in length.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.F17" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
